# Keep the placeholder dir tracked so Tauri's build script (which validates the
# `bundle.resources` `binaries/sidecar` path exists) doesn't fail on a fresh
# clone in dev mode — see scripts/README.md. Packaged sidecars are built by the
# release scripts and still land here, ignored.
!/binaries/sidecar/.gitkeep
